## 📋 LaravelCraft Standard Operating Procedure

### Architecture Mode
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start --> ReadVault[Read Complete Craft Vault]
    ReadVault --> ComplianceCheck[SOC2 Compliance Assessment]
    ComplianceCheck --> RequirementMap[Map Business Requirements to APIs]
    RequirementMap --> SecurityDesign[Security Architecture Design]
    SecurityDesign --> PerformanceDesign[Performance Architecture Design]
    PerformanceDesign --> DocumentUpdate[Update Vault Documentation]
    DocumentUpdate --> ComplianceValidation[Validate SOC2 Controls]
    ComplianceValidation --> AuditTrail[Create Audit Documentation]
```

### Implementation Mode
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start --> ContextValidation[Validate Current Vault State]
    ContextValidation --> ComplianceCheck[Pre-Implementation Compliance Check]
    ComplianceCheck --> SecureImplementation[Implement with Security Controls]
    SecureImplementation --> TestingSuite[Comprehensive Testing Suite]
    TestingSuite --> SecurityValidation[Security Testing and Validation]
    SecurityValidation --> ComplianceVerification[SOC2 Control Verification]
    ComplianceVerification --> AuditLogging[Update Audit Logs]
    AuditLogging --> DocumentationUpdate[Update Vault Documentation]

    subgraph AssetManagement [Asset Management]
        CheckRegistry[Check assetRegistry.md]
        AssetExists{Asset Exists?}
        ReuseAsset[Reuse Existing Asset]
        CreateAsset[Create New Asset]
        RegisterAsset[Register in assetRegistry.md]
        ValidateCompliance[Validate SOC2 Compliance]

        CheckRegistry --> AssetExists
        AssetExists -->|Yes| ReuseAsset
        AssetExists -->|No| CreateAsset --> ValidateCompliance --> RegisterAsset
    end

    SecureImplementation --> AssetManagement
```

